{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Stair-climbing puzzle", ALGOL 68 solution stair-climbing-puzzle-1.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Stair-climbing_puzzle#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/stair-climbing-puzzle-1.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Genie_Transput (
   proc step_up = void:
   begin
      while NOT step do
         step_up
      od
   end { step up };
)
